# One query for every outcome of trying to record Napoleon's height: a value, a bad value, a bound,
# a reason in place of a value, a status about a datum, a failed attempt, an asserted absence, or an
# answer of "unknown". Each row says which kind it found.
PREFIX rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
PREFIX prov:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#>
PREFIX ex:      <https://example.org/napoleon/>
PREFIX OBI:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_>
PREFIX IAO:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_>
PREFIX COB:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/COB_>
PREFIX RO:      <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_>
PREFIX BFO:     <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_>
PREFIX NCIT:    <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_>

SELECT ?kind ?subject ?detail WHERE {
  {
    ?subject IAO:0000136 ex:napoleonHeight ; OBI:0001938 ?vs .
    ?vs OBI:0001937 ?v .
    OPTIONAL { ?vs prov:wasGeneratedBy ?run }
    BIND(IF(isBlank(?v), "value exists, unknown",
         IF(!isNumeric(?v), "value that is not a number",
         IF(BOUND(?run), "value produced by a conversion", "value"))) AS ?kind)
    BIND(STR(?v) AS ?detail)
  } UNION {
    ?subject IAO:0000136 ex:napoleonHeight ; OBI:0001938 ?vs .
    ?vs a ?r . ?r owl:onProperty OBI:0001937 .
    BIND("bounded or unknown value" AS ?kind) BIND("" AS ?detail)
  } UNION {
    ?subject IAO:0000136 ex:napoleonHeight ; OBI:0001938 ?reason .
    ?reason a ?c . FILTER(STRSTARTS(STR(?c), "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_"))
    BIND("reason in place of a value" AS ?kind) BIND(STR(?c) AS ?detail)
  } UNION {
    ?status IAO:0000136 ?subject ; a ?c .
    FILTER(STRSTARTS(STR(?c), "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GENEPIO_"))
    BIND("status about a datum" AS ?kind) BIND(STR(?c) AS ?detail)
  } UNION {
    ?subject a COB:0000083 ; RO:0000057 ex:napoleon .
    OPTIONAL { ?subject COB:0000085 ?intended }
    BIND("failed attempt" AS ?kind) BIND(COALESCE(STR(?intended), "") AS ?detail)
  } UNION {
    ?subject a ?neg . ?neg owl:complementOf ?r . ?r owl:onProperty BFO:0000051 ; owl:someValuesFrom OBI:0003817 .
    BIND("asserted: no height measurement" AS ?kind) BIND("complement class" AS ?detail)
  } UNION {
    ?npa a owl:NegativePropertyAssertion ; owl:sourceIndividual ?subject ; owl:assertionProperty BFO:0000051 .
    BIND("asserted: no height measurement" AS ?kind) BIND("negative property assertion" AS ?detail)
  } UNION {
    ?subject IAO:0000136 ex:napoleonHeight ; OBI:0001938 ?ans . ?ans a NCIT:C79729 .
    BIND("answer was unknown" AS ?kind) BIND("NCIT:C79729" AS ?detail)
  }
}
